  dedicatedUIPrefab: {fileID: 117869517130905465, guid: b6ec8c54e3d742d4089fa94159cb0604, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'They are neither entirely truth nor danger, but a record. These runes once held
    the true history of this place, of the Creator''s initial influence and how it
    was perverted. '
  - Gareth seeks to erase that history, to keep his twisted 'order' unchallenged.
    These runes are fragments of that past, scattered and hidden. Only by piecing
    them together can you understand what truly happened here.
